  "chapter": "STARTING_OUT_WITH_LINES",
  "description": "Your initial supply of the vital §bIndium§r will be obtained by combining §epurified Galena§r and §eSphalerite Ore§r with §eSulfuric Acid§r in a mixer. This method is your primary gateway to advanced circuitry.

While later stages of progression will yield §bIndium§r more efficiently from the §bNaqLine§r, that is a future goal.

The core application for §bIndium§r is in the synthesis of §aIndium Gallium Phosphate§r, a critical component for §dIV and higher-tier circuits§r.

§r§l§6Strategic Tip:§r Since this initial method specifically requires §o§6purified versions§r§o of these ores, consider designing your ore processing system to not use the purified ores, or create a §6dedicated system§r for them to ensure a consistent supply without disrupting other operations.",
